      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "https://twitter.com/noriben327/status/1502232276952059908\nHere is how to test for SPS-I. (Setting changes are required each time the Unity is restarted.)\n(Enable Mock HMD and move it to top, change Stereo Rendering Mode to Single Pass Instanced.)\nCan be used with CyanEmu(and maybe ClientSim).\nIf the shader is not compatible with SPS-I, it will rendered only to left eye or rendered differently for left and right eye.",
